-----------------------------
Copyright (c) 2026, BeatGrid Studio contributors
License: BSD 3-Clause (same terms as upstream; see LICENSE)

New files:
  src/beat-analysis.ts
      Onset detection (log-compressed spectral flux, adaptive threshold peak
      picking), tempo estimation (comb energy x tooth uniformity^2 x tooth
      coverage), phase fitting, beat enumeration, snapping and quantisation
      helpers. Pure functions; no DOM and no wavesurfer dependency.
  src/plugins/beatgrid.ts
      BeatGridPlugin: beat grid overlay (bar / beat / subdivision tiers),
      optional region snapping, bar looping, tap tempo, and the public API.
  src/__tests__/beat-analysis.test.ts
  src/__tests__/beatgrid.test.ts
  src/__tests__/demo-audio.test.ts
